</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/52cead58-bbd4-11f1-9d1c-8f3418d01115/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-09-02T111048Z-1278872644-RC21Z9AGZE2Z-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-GRAINS-TURKEY.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/52cead58-bbd4-11f1-9d1c-8f3418d01115/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-09-02T111048Z-1278872644-RC21Z9AGZE2Z-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-GRAINS-TURKEY.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">c977200a-bbe0-11f1-b99b-77f2e91b48a3</guid><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 10:35:57 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/52cead58-bbd4-11f1-9d1c-8f3418d01115/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-09-02T111048Z-1278872644-RC21Z9AGZE2Z-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-GRAINS-TURKEY.jpg">© Ukrainian Presidential Press Service via Reuters</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Europe</category><title>Trump 'surprised' UK granted bail to suspects in alleged airbase terror plot</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260929-trump-surprised-uk-granted-bail-to-suspects-alleged-airbase-terror-plot</link><description>
